WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.501
Nice to meet you! Age, phone number and time.

2
00:00:05.951 --> 00:00:07.576
Hi! I'm Tom. What's your name?

3
00:00:08.026 --> 00:00:09.884
I'm Lily. Nice to meet you!

4
00:00:10.334 --> 00:00:11.681
How old are you, Lily?

5
00:00:12.131 --> 00:00:13.756
I'm twenty-three. And you?

6
00:00:14.206 --> 00:00:15.460
I'm twenty-five.

7
00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:18.964
What's your phone number?

8
00:00:19.414 --> 00:00:23.222
It's nine eight seven, five five four, two one three zero.

9
00:00:23.672 --> 00:00:25.019
Can you repeat, please?

10
00:00:25.469 --> 00:00:29.184
Nine eight seven, five five four, two one three zero.

11
00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:32.502
What time is it?

12
00:00:32.952 --> 00:00:34.206
It's six fifteen.

13
00:00:36.456 --> 00:00:40.357
Oh no! My English class is at six thirty. Bye, Tom!

14
00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.339
Bye, Lily! See you!

